─ hint ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 core/backup-live-console: Backups: live, with console save hooks               
 Sets [flk.backup] mode = "live" with console pre and post hooks.               
 flk volumes backup types each pre line into the app's console (its stdin, the  
 serial console), waits for the wait regex after the last one, then copies the  
 running volume and runs e2fsck on the copy. The post lines run afterwards      
 whatever happened. The console must reach the app: stdin "console" (the        
